{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Avoid the caller-controlled self-type cast.** The generic type is unrelated to the receiver's runtime type, so assigning this result to an arbitrary subclass compiles but throws `ClassCastException`. Return `DurableOperationException` directly, then have `attachPayloadSource` mutate and return its already typed `E` argument.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7oiBLi","finding_digest":"269b117551369b06280267a9b137579c7ef4918e0dfe7ad45446711ccab8b514","finding_id":"arf_v1_e2nrc5krg2nqmkacm6u3cn2xtr","finding_key":"sdk/exception/durableoperationexception::withpayloadsource::unchecked-self-type","identity_key":"sdk/exception/durableoperationexception::withpayloadsource::unchecked-self-type","line":75,"observation_digest":"4cb33ab81937ac4d2582b03cd9eb954dab44d0f7dcdf3a71c3cf59bc23907cb5","observation_id":"aro_v1_jsztvoazg6we2jmcwa6nt24vjw","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/exception/DurableOperationException.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-01T06:05:17Z","review_id":"arr_v1_yyzbqnknvmtxb2m3lrzaqpdkbd","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"1a9eeb8806701298af193a57d2ace64f6220d234","reviewer":"codex","start_line":69,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":649},"record_id":"art_v1_ex25cowoxv5yxalf4crg5paaok","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T06:05:17Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
